@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@loanId = GANTI_DENGAN_ID_DARI_RESPONSE_POST

### Cek API
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Tambah peminjaman
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "member_name": "Budi Santoso",
  "member_email": "budi@example.com",
  "book_title": "Laskar Pelangi",
  "author": "Andrea Hirata",
  "loan_date": "2026-10-10",
  "due_date": "2026-10-17"
}

### Lihat semua peminjaman
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/loans

### Filter peminjaman terlambat
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/loans?status=Terlambat

### Lihat satu peminjaman
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/loans/{{loanId}}

### Ubah data/status (PATCH hanya mengubah field yang dikirim)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/loans/{{loanId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Dikembalikan"
}

### Hapus data (permanen)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/loans/{{loanId}}
